[WORK]
UID: WORK-PATH-NOT-LOAD-BEARING
TITLE: Paths serve navigation, never meaning
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
Stop the directory path being load-bearing. The operator hates that meaning
rides on where a file sits; paths should serve navigation only. Today's
load-bearing uses to unwind: the systems table keys membership on source
directory prefixes (DEC-SYSTEM-IS-A-SOURCE-SET), plan membership IS the
plan directory, and dir_class derives from the path.
<<<
